    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今回の号で専属モデルの人\r\n卒業発表するって本当ですか～？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "ああ、うん、そうみたい\r\n一応誌面で出るまで内緒ね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ、はい～\r\nそれはもちろん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "大学受験するんだって\r\n大変よねぇ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "でも今ってこういう業界でも\r\n進学する子が多いからなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "ちょっと前なんかは芸能一本！　とかって子も\r\n多かったけどねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "雛菜ちゃんはどうするの？\r\n今２年生だっけ、３年生？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\n雛菜、まだ１年生ですよ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "あれ、そうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "メイクスタッフ",
    "text": "じゃあまだまだ雛菜ちゃんのメイクは\r\nやらせてもらえそうねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
