  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ先のことかもしれないけど\r\n雛菜がどうしたいか決まったら、教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～\r\nそっか～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "けど、すぐにこれ！　って決まらないかも～\r\n今日決めても、明日変わるかもしれないし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それもそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "決まったらっていうか、決まらなくても\r\nどう考えてるかだけでも聞けたら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～、そう～？\r\nそれでいいのか～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020260,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃ、もっと考えとくね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020260"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雛菜がどうしていきたいか、\r\nいつでも聞かせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日と明日で、変わったら\r\nそれも教えてくれたら嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020270,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nそしたら雛菜、毎日プロデューサーに話さないと",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな\r\n俺は、それでも構わないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020280,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そう～？\r\nじゃ、毎日連絡してあげないとだね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020280"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "具体的じゃなくても、\r\n考えてることがあれば聞かせて欲しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その為に、何かできることがあるかもしれないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020290,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……うん、そうだね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし俺にできることがなければ\r\n一緒に見つけていきたいし、そうしないといけない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020300,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023009020310,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか、雛菜の将来が、\r\nプロデューサーの将来も変えちゃいそうだね～",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300902/2023009020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そうかもしれないな",
